Regional Outlook
North America is the largest regional market, supported by mature diagnostic networks, reimbursement frameworks and strong research funding.
Asia-Pacific is the fastest-growing region as cancer incidence, private healthcare investment and government genomics programs expand.
Europe is strengthening NGS adoption through coordinated genomic initiatives and national cancer programs.
South America is gradually expanding precision-oncology testing through tertiary cancer centers and public-private initiatives.
Middle East & Africa offer longer-term opportunities through capacity-building programs, advanced healthcare investments and growing oncology awareness.
